WEBVTT

00:36.550 --> 00:39.510
Yokoya

00:57.530 --> 01:00.330
Yes, coming!

01:02.620 --> 01:05.540
Right, uh...

01:06.080 --> 01:07.750
Could I ask who's...

01:10.250 --> 01:13.510
<i>Forgive me for the imposition,</i>

01:13.510 --> 01:18.180
<i>but would you be willing 
to employ me as your servant?</i>

01:19.050 --> 01:22.350
<i>Out of the blue one day, 
a maid showed up to work.</i>

02:57.190 --> 03:00.950
<b>Episode 1: My Fateful Encounter with You.</b>

03:01.450 --> 03:04.950
I'm sorry. My parents aren't around 
currently, so the place is a mess.

03:04.950 --> 03:05.870
It's fine.

03:06.580 --> 03:08.660
Oh, would you like something to drink?

03:08.660 --> 03:09.660
Please don't trouble yourself.

03:15.540 --> 03:17.760
<i>I let her in without thinking, but...</i>

03:17.760 --> 03:18.960
<b>Gyokuro Tea</b>

03:20.920 --> 03:23.760
<i>Did she really come here to work?</i>

03:23.760 --> 03:27.600
<i>She's not trying to scam me 
or sell something shady, right?</i>

03:28.220 --> 03:31.060
<i>Maybe I'll just ask some token questions 
and have her go home.</i>

03:31.060 --> 03:33.020
<b>Gyokuro Tea</b>

03:31.690 --> 03:32.600
Um...

03:33.020 --> 03:38.150
Since you're a servant, you must have 
previously worked somewhere, right?

03:38.150 --> 03:39.740
What kind of work did you mainly do?

03:40.780 --> 03:42.320
Well, let's see.

03:42.860 --> 03:44.870
I mainly performed assassinations and such,

03:44.870 --> 03:48.540
though only to kill disloyal men 
who wronged my master.

03:48.540 --> 03:53.250
My master was the one 
who referred me to this place.

03:54.790 --> 03:57.880
Um, that was a joke, right?

03:59.840 --> 04:01.630
A joke?

04:01.630 --> 04:02.800
<i>She needs to leave!</i>

04:02.800 --> 04:05.800
<i>I just have to get her out of here 
without upsetting her!</i>

04:07.180 --> 04:11.980
Um... What did you mean when you said 
your master referred you?

04:11.980 --> 04:14.520
Do they have some kind of 
connection with our family?

04:16.690 --> 04:21.070
You are the grandson of a woman 
who used to freeload off of

04:21.070 --> 04:23.990
my master's legitimate child's 
wife's cousin's second son.

04:23.990 --> 04:25.280
That's practically a stranger!

04:25.280 --> 04:28.330
<i>Oh! Oh, no! I cut her off 
and played the straight man!</i>

04:28.330 --> 04:29.910
<i>Eek, she kinda looks mad!</i>

04:29.910 --> 04:31.250
<i>I have to change the subject!</i>

04:31.540 --> 04:35.460
S-So, assassination, huh? 
I understand there are all kinds of methods.

04:35.460 --> 04:37.880
Which do you specialize in?

04:59.060 --> 05:00.230
What do you think?

05:00.230 --> 05:01.400
Prideful much?

05:03.360 --> 05:07.530
I don't often throw them in practice, 
but I thought doing it this way

05:07.530 --> 05:11.080
would make it easier to demonstrate my skills.

05:12.450 --> 05:17.210
U-Um... I don't have anyone 
I need a-assassinated.

05:17.500 --> 05:21.460
And I'm not familiar with this 
master of yours who referred you.

05:22.090 --> 05:24.300
I don't really understand 
why you're here, but...

05:25.260 --> 05:27.130
I'm afraid... I can't...

05:28.180 --> 05:29.640
hire you.

05:35.850 --> 05:37.560
I see.

05:38.810 --> 05:41.900
My apologies for troubling you.

05:42.610 --> 05:44.610
Now then, if you will excuse me.

06:00.040 --> 06:01.500
Did I dream all that?

06:04.300 --> 06:05.050
Hm?

06:17.020 --> 06:18.890
<i>That's practically a stranger!</i>

06:22.230 --> 06:25.280
<i>What was I getting so excited for?</i>

06:25.780 --> 06:27.860
<i>Where should I go now....</i>

06:50.510 --> 06:51.930
Hey!

06:52.390 --> 06:56.100
Ms. Servant! You forgot this!

07:09.900 --> 07:11.570
Watch where you're going!

07:15.740 --> 07:17.830
Ms... Servant?

07:18.620 --> 07:20.830
A-Are... you all right?

07:21.290 --> 07:23.380
Th-Thank you.

07:24.000 --> 07:26.340
M-My apologies.

07:26.340 --> 07:30.720
I've never saved someone's 
life like this before, and...

07:30.720 --> 07:33.340
M-My heart won't stop pounding.

07:36.680 --> 07:38.930
Here... You left this behind.

07:43.600 --> 07:45.400
Thank you.

07:57.830 --> 07:58.990
Ms. Servant!

08:01.620 --> 08:04.540
I've actually been looking for someone 
to help with the cleaning.

08:04.540 --> 08:06.000
Can I ask for your assistance?

08:07.540 --> 08:09.300
<b>Yokoya</b>

08:14.180 --> 08:15.300
The knife,

08:15.300 --> 08:18.470
said to be the very first tool 
ever employed by mankind.

08:18.470 --> 08:20.270
Simple enough for anyone to use,

08:20.270 --> 08:24.400
and yet, in the hands of a practiced wielder, 
it can reliably end a target's life.

08:23.310 --> 08:25.020
W-Wait, wait, stop!

08:25.020 --> 08:28.400
I-I know I said something 
along the lines of needing help,

08:28.400 --> 08:29.820
but what I want you to do is clean!

08:29.820 --> 08:31.150
You know, cleaning!

08:31.150 --> 08:33.360
Clean... Cleaning...

08:34.240 --> 08:36.700
Yes. I know all about "cleaning."

08:36.700 --> 08:38.700
Not in the assassination sense!

08:38.700 --> 08:40.540
What other kind of "cleaning" would it be?

08:40.540 --> 08:43.160
Oh, come on. Look at this mess of a room!

08:43.160 --> 08:45.250
And yes, I'm the one who made said mess, but!

08:46.210 --> 08:47.080
I see.

08:47.500 --> 08:49.420
One of these must be a body bag—

08:49.420 --> 08:51.210
Let's move away from that for one second!

08:51.210 --> 08:54.630
I mean, like, you know... Taking out 
the trash, vacuuming, doing laundry...

08:54.970 --> 08:57.010
What I need is a housekeeper!

08:57.010 --> 08:58.600
A housekeeper...

09:01.470 --> 09:03.770
<i>She did save my life, after all,</i>

09:04.270 --> 09:07.230
<i>and she doesn't seem like a bad person.</i>

09:08.310 --> 09:13.940
If I could do this housework, 
you would hire me?

09:18.870 --> 09:20.580
<b>Yokoya</b>

09:22.790 --> 09:24.330
<i>What just happened?</i>

09:25.040 --> 09:27.620
<i>I only just gave her the equipment!</i>

09:27.620 --> 09:29.630
<i>How can she be so clumsy?!</i>

09:30.920 --> 09:33.880
M-M-My apologies.

09:33.880 --> 09:35.970
I-I will clean this up right away—

09:37.930 --> 09:40.390
Ms. Servant...

09:42.560 --> 09:44.180
I'm sorry to have worried you.

09:44.180 --> 09:46.440
I cannot be embarrassing myself any—

09:46.440 --> 09:48.810
<i>Oh, man.</i>

09:49.150 --> 09:50.770
Ms. Servant, are you...

09:51.150 --> 09:52.730
somewhat—no, extremely...

09:53.110 --> 09:54.440
clumsy?

09:57.530 --> 09:59.660
I am truly sorry.

10:00.120 --> 10:02.280
After a string of blunders like these,

10:02.280 --> 10:03.910
I'm sure you no longer wish to hire me.

10:08.710 --> 10:12.130
Well, I was the one who asked you to do 
something you weren't used to, and...

10:16.380 --> 10:18.970
It's never too late to start learning, right?

10:18.970 --> 10:20.180
I'll help, too.

10:20.720 --> 10:23.350
No, let's clean up together.

10:23.350 --> 10:24.810
Will you help me?

10:32.150 --> 10:34.440
Whoa!

10:34.440 --> 10:37.900
The living room looks so tidy! 
We're off to a great start!

10:38.360 --> 10:41.370
I just couldn't motivate myself 
to do it on my own.

10:41.370 --> 10:44.280
You really helped me out. Thanks!

10:46.540 --> 10:48.960
Oh, man! I didn't realize how late it was!

10:48.960 --> 10:51.790
I had so much going on 
that I forgot to eat lunch.

10:51.790 --> 10:52.290
Oh!

10:52.290 --> 10:54.550
By any chance, would you happen 
to be able to cook...

10:55.550 --> 10:57.510
Ah... Yeah, sorry.

10:57.840 --> 11:01.180
No worries! I have the ultimate menu 
already in mind for tonight!

11:01.180 --> 11:02.720
So feel free to use the bath first!

11:11.560 --> 11:14.020
You really helped me out. Thanks!

11:20.860 --> 11:22.740
<i>My name is Hitoyoshi Yokoya!</i>

11:22.740 --> 11:25.080
<i>I'm your average sophomore in high school.</i>

11:25.450 --> 11:29.040
<i>I'm fully enjoying a summer vacation 
without my parents around,</i>

11:29.040 --> 11:32.000
<i>and right now I'm feeling 
more nervous than ever!</i>

11:32.670 --> 11:36.300
<i>After all, a maid suddenly showed up 
claiming to be an assassin...</i>

11:36.960 --> 11:38.090
<i>No, not because of that!</i>

11:43.050 --> 11:44.850
<i>Wh-What should I do?!</i>

11:44.850 --> 11:48.890
<i>Knowing that lady, she's probably going to 
carelessly come out wearing only a towel—</i>

11:48.220 --> 11:49.060
Um...

11:48.890 --> 11:49.520
Y-Yes?!

11:49.520 --> 11:51.440
Thank you for allowing me to bathe first.

11:51.440 --> 11:53.270
My lost youth!

11:55.230 --> 11:57.860
Um, you don't have to force yourself, okay?

11:58.150 --> 12:01.570
That's quite all right. Knifework is the 
one thing I'm better at than anyone else.

12:13.080 --> 12:15.380
I have finished shredding the cabbage!

12:15.380 --> 12:16.790
Th-Thank you.

12:17.420 --> 12:22.170
All that's left is to prepare the instant 
miso soup and place the tonkatsu side dish!

12:22.170 --> 12:23.430
Tonkatsu...

12:23.430 --> 12:25.840
Huh? Do you not know what tonkatsu is?

12:26.220 --> 12:29.970
I may have eaten something 
resembling it in the past.

12:29.970 --> 12:33.940
However, I have little interest in food, 
and I tend not to remember much about it.

12:34.270 --> 12:39.190
I've always thought of food as something 
ingested solely to sustain oneself,

12:39.610 --> 12:42.280
and so I've never cared 
about its taste or form.

12:42.280 --> 12:43.900
Are you serious?! What a waste!

12:44.450 --> 12:48.620
But... Your world is about to change 
once you try this tonkatsu!

12:48.620 --> 12:49.870
Ta-da!

12:49.870 --> 12:51.660
Established 60 years ago,

12:49.870 --> 12:54.580
<b>Katsuda Side Dish Store</b>

12:51.660 --> 12:54.580
the Katsuda Side Dish Store is the pride 
of our town's shopping district!

12:54.580 --> 12:59.750
<b>Pumpkin Croquette</b>

12:54.580 --> 12:59.750
<b>130 yen</b>

12:54.580 --> 12:59.750
<b>Minced Meat Croquette</b>

12:54.580 --> 12:59.750
<b>130 yen</b>

12:54.580 --> 12:59.750
<b>Croquette</b>

12:54.580 --> 12:59.750
<b>110 yen</b>

12:54.920 --> 12:57.790
Early in the morning, Mr. and 
Mrs. Katsuda carefully prepare

12:57.790 --> 12:59.750
side dishes that are 
not only cheap but delicious!

12:59.750 --> 13:03.720
<b>Katsuda Side Dish Store</b>

13:00.090 --> 13:03.720
It's rumored that even famous celebrities 
secretly turn up for a taste!

13:04.010 --> 13:07.010
And now, without further ado... 
Please enjoy Katsuda's tonkatsu!

13:08.140 --> 13:10.850
You're kidding me! 
That was the dullest reaction yet!

13:11.390 --> 13:14.020
Um... Please go ahead and eat.

13:17.150 --> 13:18.190
No worries!

13:19.320 --> 13:20.270
If we do this...

13:20.770 --> 13:24.110
and do that... See!

13:24.490 --> 13:26.160
Dinner for two is served!

13:26.160 --> 13:27.490
For me and you, Ms. Serv—

13:27.950 --> 13:28.990
Come to think of it...

13:28.990 --> 13:30.950
What <i>is</i> your name, Ms. Servant?

13:31.620 --> 13:34.790
A name... I don't have a name.

13:35.710 --> 13:40.170
Until now, I've had my employer 
call me whatever they wish to call me.

13:40.670 --> 13:44.970
So you, too, may call me 
whatever you wish, Master Yokoya.

13:44.970 --> 13:47.840
Oh, really? Hm...

13:47.840 --> 13:51.180
Well, if that's okay, I guess I'll stick 
with Ms. Servant for now?

13:51.180 --> 13:53.930
Apparently I suck at coming up with names.

13:55.980 --> 13:57.310
<i>That's strange.</i>

13:57.980 --> 14:02.110
<i>I never cared about what name 
I was called until now...</i>

14:03.280 --> 14:04.070
Now, then!

14:04.570 --> 14:06.070
Let's eat!

14:06.070 --> 14:07.320
Let us eat.

14:08.950 --> 14:11.490
Yep! Delish! I might just be a genius!

14:20.630 --> 14:22.420
Wh-What do you think?

14:24.130 --> 14:25.130
<i>As usual,</i>

14:25.590 --> 14:29.050
<i>I can't distinguish whether 
it tastes good or bad.</i>

14:29.800 --> 14:31.010
<i>However...</i>

14:38.020 --> 14:39.480
<i>I feel... warmth.</i>

14:40.270 --> 14:41.060
How is it? Good?

14:41.730 --> 14:44.650
Yes. It is most delicious.

14:45.030 --> 14:46.440
I'm glad to hear that!

14:47.070 --> 14:48.360
<i>I feel warmth...</i>

14:49.490 --> 14:51.450
<i>From the bath, the meal...</i>

14:52.200 --> 14:53.830
<i>and this person, as well.</i>

14:53.830 --> 14:57.580
Oh! Is it okay if your room is the end room 
on the second floor, Ms. Servant?

14:57.580 --> 14:58.620
Oh...

14:58.620 --> 15:02.420
I put on fresh bed sheets and pillow covers,

15:02.420 --> 15:04.960
but if anything's wrong, just tell me, okay?

15:04.960 --> 15:07.130
You prepared a room for me...?

15:07.130 --> 15:08.170
Yep!

15:09.970 --> 15:10.800
<i>A name...</i>

15:11.340 --> 15:12.800
I don't have a name.

15:12.800 --> 15:14.430
You pass.

15:14.430 --> 15:19.060
You have skin that's white as snow, 
and a heart that's just as cold.

15:19.060 --> 15:20.390
Starting today, your name is...

15:20.390 --> 15:21.980
I don't have a name.

15:23.110 --> 15:26.650
<i>I see. So that's why.</i>

15:26.650 --> 15:30.240
<i>I don't want him to call me 
something that means "cold."</i>

15:30.650 --> 15:34.580
Hm... Oh? You're eating 
that tonkatsu on its own.

15:35.660 --> 15:37.160
Was I not supposed to?

15:37.160 --> 15:39.330
You need tonkatsu sauce for tonkatsu.

15:39.330 --> 15:42.460
This one's a Katsuda Side Dish Store original!

15:42.460 --> 15:43.920
Tonkatsu sauce...

15:43.920 --> 15:45.380
<b>Katsuda's Sauce</b>

15:58.140 --> 16:00.850
Oh!

16:01.850 --> 16:03.350
Was it delicious?

16:03.350 --> 16:05.270
Ye...sh...

16:06.320 --> 16:09.780
<b>Katsuda's Sauce</b>

16:06.690 --> 16:09.780
Tonkatsu... sauce...

16:23.960 --> 16:26.630
It's been a while since I had that dream.

16:32.590 --> 16:34.470
I think I've got some cup ramen left.

16:39.640 --> 16:42.350
<i>What?! There's someone in the kitchen?!</i>

16:43.350 --> 16:45.440
<i>I mainly performed assassinations...</i>

16:45.440 --> 16:47.060
<i>No way...</i>

16:47.520 --> 16:49.440
<i>I-It can't be, right?</i>

17:05.210 --> 17:06.380
Oh! Um!

17:06.380 --> 17:08.710
I-I was just... My apologies!

17:08.710 --> 17:11.920
No, it's fine. 
That's several loads off my mind.

17:13.970 --> 17:16.300
Were you hungry, Ms. Servant?

17:16.300 --> 17:18.180
I got hungry, too, so...

17:18.180 --> 17:20.180
Well, I...

17:20.180 --> 17:23.640
When I thought of how any day—
tomorrow included—could be my last,

17:23.640 --> 17:28.190
I was thinking I wouldn't want to die without 
tasting this sauce one last time, so...

17:28.480 --> 17:30.820
Then I have a great idea!

17:33.440 --> 17:36.030
Pseudo sauce fondue!

17:36.450 --> 17:39.160
The ingredients aren't anything 
to write home about, but...

17:39.160 --> 17:40.240
Eat up, eat up!

17:45.910 --> 17:48.500
Tonkatsu... sauce...

17:48.500 --> 17:51.920
Do you just like the taste of the sauce itself?

17:53.760 --> 17:54.840
Um...

17:54.840 --> 17:58.510
Did you have some kind of 
scary dream, Master Yokoya?

17:58.510 --> 17:59.550
Huh? Why do you ask?

17:59.890 --> 18:02.770
When I left my bed to go lick the s-sauce,

18:02.770 --> 18:07.650
I heard groaning coming from your room.

18:08.100 --> 18:11.230
I considered the very real possibility 
of an assassination attempt

18:11.230 --> 18:13.860
and excused myself into your room.

18:13.860 --> 18:15.320
What possibility, exactly?!

18:16.200 --> 18:18.280
So... did you see me?

18:23.830 --> 18:27.120
Th-That's so embarrassing! Did I say anything?

18:27.120 --> 18:29.670
Yes. You said "Mom" numerous times.

18:32.130 --> 18:33.460
I also...

18:34.710 --> 18:36.550
had a dream.

18:37.340 --> 18:40.090
The tonkatsu sauce started to talk to me.

18:38.260 --> 18:41.220
<b>Katsuda's Sauce</b>

18:40.090 --> 18:41.220
Talk?

18:41.220 --> 18:45.430
<b>Katsuda's Sauce</b>

18:41.220 --> 18:45.430
It said, "I'm this big, so no matter how 
much you lick me, I won't run out."

18:45.850 --> 18:48.140
"You can have as much as you like."

18:48.140 --> 18:52.270
But when I went in for a lick, I woke up.

18:52.270 --> 18:54.860
Oh, man... It's the super sad kind.

18:55.360 --> 18:56.190
Still...

18:59.610 --> 19:01.410
It was a first for me.

19:01.990 --> 19:07.580
Up until now, my only dreams have 
been about killing or being killed.

19:07.580 --> 19:13.460
And I never felt anything in particular 
from my dreams, or from waking up.

19:14.210 --> 19:18.920
It was the first time I ever felt 
like I wanted to keep dreaming.

19:19.880 --> 19:20.930
That's why...

19:21.430 --> 19:28.600
I felt a little sorry that you had 
to have a nightmare on a day like this.

19:29.230 --> 19:34.610
And above that, that I didn't know 
of any ways to make you feel better.

19:35.320 --> 19:38.490
That is what made me feel 
so sad and unfulfilled.

19:39.110 --> 19:41.240
Sorry to make you worry.

19:41.240 --> 19:43.070
I have that dream every once in a while.

19:43.530 --> 19:45.910
Mom... Where are you going?

19:45.910 --> 19:47.040
Mom...

19:48.620 --> 19:53.750
I always had nightmares as a child, 
and whenever I would wake up crying,

19:53.750 --> 19:57.090
I could never get back to sleep without 
resting my head on my mom's lap.

19:58.800 --> 20:00.090
Resting on a lap...

20:03.140 --> 20:03.800
Then...

20:06.600 --> 20:08.970
Please rest on my lap.

20:13.810 --> 20:14.610
What?

20:14.610 --> 20:15.940
No! No, no, no, no!

20:15.940 --> 20:17.400
That was back when I was a kid!

20:17.400 --> 20:20.150
Right now, I'm an ordinary boy who 
understands public order and morals!

20:20.150 --> 20:23.610
And besides, an adolescent boy 
shouldn't be... Huh?

20:24.450 --> 20:26.700
<i>As I thought, I'm not...</i>

20:27.080 --> 20:31.080
<i>You were born only to kill.</i>

20:31.080 --> 20:34.250
<i>I'm... I'm not...</i>

20:35.380 --> 20:38.380
<i>Oh... I feel so cold...</i>

20:48.510 --> 20:49.430
<i>So soft!</i>

20:49.430 --> 20:50.640
It's so warm!

20:51.230 --> 20:53.940
Yes... For me, too.

20:56.650 --> 20:58.860
Um... Master Yokoya?

20:58.860 --> 21:02.700
Uh, um... You can just
call me Hitoyoshi, so...

21:02.700 --> 21:04.860
U-Understood.

21:04.860 --> 21:06.450
Then I think... I'll be...

21:09.120 --> 21:12.870
Do you think you can sleep
now, Master Hitoyoshi?

21:16.210 --> 21:18.960
<b>Yokoya</b>

21:16.830 --> 21:18.960
Yeah... Thank you.

21:22.590 --> 21:28.390
<i>This is a story about how a 
lonely maid found a family.</i>
